["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Bronze Age Syria: Cradle of Cities Amorite Hurrian cuneiform vassal king Mitanni\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-ancients-叙利亚不是帝国争霸的过道-而是人类最早和平条约的诞生地/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/443cfc236f2ce59c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>敘利亞不是帝國爭霸的過道，而是人類最早和平條約的誕生地</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">公元前2300年埃卜拉與鄰國簽下的條約裡，連「信使等超過十天要管飯」這種細節都寫明瞭——外交規則那時就已成熟，敘利亞是規則的發明者，不是夾縫中的通道。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古代近東</span><span class=\"tag\">外交史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: William Palmer strychnine antimony coroner&#x27;s inquest apoplexy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-24-stuffmissed-尸体里验不出毒药-陪审团却只花75分钟判他绞刑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">34:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>屍體裡驗不出毒藥，陪審團卻只花75分鐘判他絞刑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">連環投保受益人接連死亡、屍檢程序混亂、屍體裡驗不出番木鱉鹼——陪審團仍只憑動機和巧合給Palmer定了死罪，這案子至今仍有人質疑是冤案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">投毒</span><span class=\"tag\">人壽保險欺詐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM Highlights: Clean Neurons, Black October, the GPU Credit Crunch, and Buying the Supply Chain cognitive core Harberger tax polysemanticity bitter lesson adversarial diffusion take-or-pay contract\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-24-cogrev-创业ai实验室真正缺的不是gpu-而是信用评级/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4b361faf0df2675a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>創業AI實驗室真正缺的不是GPU，而是信用評級</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">放貸人收回一臺超算後根本不知道它值多少錢，於是新實驗室只能靠預付全款換長約——這才是算力擴張的真正瓶頸，不是芯片或電力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力信用</span><span class=\"tag\">供應鏈瓶頸</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Malcolm Gaskill on Why Our Ancestors Weren&#x27;t as Superstitious as We Think pareidolia confessional state\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-24-goodfight-两百年猎巫审判仅十一万起-启蒙运动后数字才被夸大到百万/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>兩百年獵巫審判僅十一萬起，啟蒙運動後數字才被誇大到百萬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真實的獵巫審判記錄顯示，十六至十七世紀歐洲審判約十一萬起，陪審團常以證據不足拒絕定罪——這幅畫面遠比「集體瘋狂」複雜，也遠比後世想像的溫和。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">獵巫審判</span><span class=\"tag\">啟蒙運動</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What It Takes to Win as a Founder | Ben Horowitz GPT wrapper RDBMS solopreneur LAMP stack\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-24-a16z-被骂-gpt套壳-不是坏事-当年sap也被当成数据库套壳/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">41:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>被罵「GPT套殼」不是壞事：當年SAP也被當成數據庫套殼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說「GPT套殼」搞錯了重點：關係型數據庫剛出現時SAP也被嘲笑是數據庫套殼，真正的護城河是模型之上的專有數據，以及比對手好十倍的產品。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI創業</span><span class=\"tag\">護城河</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How a Chicago Restaurant Has Stayed Open For Nearly Three Decades farm-to-table ghost kitchen shared kitchen prix fixe GLP-1\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-24-oddlots-独立高端餐厅行业-整体回报率是负的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>獨立高端餐廳行業，整體回報率是負的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">開了近30年高端餐廳的老闆說，獨立餐飲沒有護城河、誰都能抄配方，守法經營還要比同行多付5%到10%成本，行業整體回報因此是負的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">餐飲</span><span class=\"tag\">小生意經濟學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Cyber Panic, Ken Griffin&#x27;s Bubble Warning, The Fall of France? PHP to shell virtual patch bond vigilantes Obliteration AI chain of thought\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-allin-ai支出的90-来自1-的公司-八成是亏损的创业公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9af963e06c2ea01b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>AI支出的90%來自1%的公司，八成是虧損的創業公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">錢從VC流向創業公司，創業公司把錢花在AI上做出營收，再回頭找VC加輪融資——這是閉環，不是真實擴散。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Embracing the Bond Market: Masters in Business with Robin Wigglesworth Consols Sukuk Securitization Bearer bond CBO\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-mastersinbiz-ai-泡沫本身不可怕-可怕的是它越来越靠发债撑着/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>AI 泡沫本身不可怕，可怕的是它越來越靠發債撐著</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">歷史數據顯示，由股權推動的泡沫破裂後經濟影響有限，由信貸推動的泡沫破裂才真正傷筋動骨，而今年AI超大廠商發債規模已從2000億美元跳到5000億美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">債券市場</span><span class=\"tag\">美國國債</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI越強大，人為什麼越累｜欽文對話馬兆遠 Testing Knowledge\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-wangqinwen-效率翻倍后是早下班还是裁员加班-决定了技术会不会让人更累/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fc78e021049c424-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"王\"><span class=\"dur\">25:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">王欽文</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>效率翻倍後是早下班還是裁員加班，決定了技術會不會讓人更累</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">羅素百年前問過同一個問題：工廠效率提高一倍後，是分享給工人更多休息，還是裁掉一半人、逼剩下的人加班自保，AI不過是這道選擇題的最新版本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生育率</span><span class=\"tag\">教育改革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Tom Milton on how we could verify a US–China deal on AI zero-knowledge proof flexHEG FPGA side channel OPCW national technical means\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-eightythousand-能验证美中ai协议的技术-全球只有约50人在做/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f395fcfe057f7280-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">1:48:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>能驗證美中AI協議的技術，全球只有約50人在做</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美中若想就AI減速達成協議，核心難題是互信；驗證技術就是把這種互信工程化成可檢查的證據——但目前全球做這件事的工程師，用個位數的團隊規模就能數完。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">算力驗證</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Amazon CEO Andy Jassy on the $220 Billion AI Buildout barbell (demand) stateful runtime environment Nitro Annapurna Labs\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-a16z-220亿美元砸下去-亚马逊ceo说2027年算力照样卖光/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>220億美元砸下去，亞馬遜CEO說2027年算力照樣賣光</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">傑西說即使今年砸220億美元資本開支，亞馬遜依然主動留下一部分需求沒滿足——2026年容量已賣光，2027年大部分賣光，2028年也賣掉一大塊，這筆錢花得值。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">資本開支</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Democratizing Security for the Agentic Web with Cloudflare CTO Dane Knecht CVE WebPKI Zero Trust AEO X402 CPM/CTM\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-nopriors-cdn巨头cto预言-未来18个月一半工程时间要用来补漏洞/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/44db1fd0a7b5258a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">41:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>CDN巨頭CTO預言：未來18個月一半工程時間要用來補漏洞</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">漏洞披露速度從一年一次變成每週多次，連TLS信任根密鑰都曾被人用種子數字4破解——CTO說未來18個月，一半工程資源要砸向安全。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Netflix Angst, The End of the Internet, Q&amp;A on Meta’s VR Glasses, Anthropic Alignment, You Can See Everything elliptical curve cryptography zero trust generative UI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-sharptech-广告模式能无限涨价不流失用户-订阅模式做不到/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>廣告模式能無限漲價不流失用戶，訂閱模式做不到</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">廣告定價能隨算法變準持續上漲、不影響用戶留存；訂閱漲價一旦引發流失就晚了——這正是奈飛參與度下滑、廣告營收目標又沒達標時真正該慌的地方。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">奈飛</span><span class=\"tag\">廣告變現</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Forgotten Godmother of Economic Literature Edgeworth box marginalists labor theory of value DSGE racked rent\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-oddlots-比简-奥斯汀还畅销的她-因在小说里说教太重被经济学史遗忘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">43:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>比簡·奧斯汀還暢銷的她，因在小說裡說教太重被經濟學史遺忘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她的小說比《國富論》原著好讀得多，卻因為教育意味太濃，在簡·奧斯汀式自然主義敘事興起後被讀者和經濟學史一起拋棄。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">經濟思想史</span><span class=\"tag\">女性經濟學家</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"反地產邏輯，為什麼成就了阿那亞｜欽文對話馬寅\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-wangqinwen-阿那亚的成功靠的是没有退路-不是战略远见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f06d53df338a0f19-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"王\"><span class=\"dur\">28:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">王欽文</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>阿那亞的成功靠的是沒有退路，不是戰略遠見</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">馬寅說如果2012年還能像別的開發商一樣快進快出賺快錢，他絕不會死磕阿那亞——是十億貸款和只剩這一個項目的絕境，逼出了這套反地產邏輯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">長期主義</span><span class=\"tag\">社區運營</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"重新定義個人電腦，老黃到底憑什麼？RTX Spark深度解析 PRISM MXC Windows on ARM PAIR Prefill/Decode MOE\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-laoshi-rtx-spark芯片没变-英伟达要的不是性能而是pc定义权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">老</div><span class=\"dur\">24:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">老石談芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>RTX Spark芯片沒變，英偉達要的不是性能而是PC定義權</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這顆芯片幾乎就是去年發布的DGX Spark換了操作系統，老黃真正想要的不是跑分贏家，而是把CPU、GPU、內存、系統捆成一套只認英偉達規則的PC新架構。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">CUDA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AI Compute Comes in Rectangles — Erik Bernhardsson, Modal CEO BYOC Neoclouds spot capacity FDE MFU\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-latentspace-gpu-稀缺的真正病根-算力只能整块按三年期打包购买/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7cf8550aeeab084a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>GPU 稀缺的真正病根：算力只能整塊按三年期打包購買</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說，GPU 短缺最大的問題不是搶不到卡，而是幾乎所有產能都打包成三到六個月後交付的三年期合約出售，這和大多數客戶真實的忽高忽低的需求完全對不上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力採購</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU稀缺</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Here’s Why Experts Keep Being Wrong About the Future radical uncertainty hindsight bias\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-goodfight-预测失败不是数据问题-是未来本身不可知/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">9:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>預測失敗不是數據問題，是未來本身不可知</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">手握數據、模型和算力的專家照樣在2008年集體失算，因為未來不是等信息補全的拼圖，而是一張還沒畫出來的空白畫布。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">不確定性</span><span class=\"tag\">預測失誤</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Frontier Ideas a16z Wants to Fund | Marc Andreessen, Ben Horowitz &amp; Chris Dixon reward hacking outer planets the covenant swarm\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-a16z-创业时代变了-该问的不是太疯狂-而是够不够疯狂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/89623e03df420598-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>創業時代變了：該問的不是太瘋狂，而是夠不夠瘋狂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">早期用AI的人和普通機構之間的認知差距，是Marc Andreessen職業生涯裡見過最大的一次，而且還在變寬——這意味著中規中矩的產品方案註定不會有差異化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">a16z</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What will computer chips look like in 2045? EUV High-NA EUV Gate-all-around (GAA) CFET Backside power Hybrid bonding\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-dwarkesh-就算无限砸钱-先进芯片产能也只能翻倍-不是十倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21bf8bafac799fac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>就算無限砸錢，先進芯片產能也只能翻倍，不是十倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英特爾CTO說，哪怕拿出無限資本開支，現有全球芯片製造設備存量也只能讓先進製程晶圓產能翻一倍——而AI算力需求過去十年每年增長三倍，缺口只會越拉越大。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半導體制造</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片產能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Recommendation Engine for Commodity Traders — Anekha Sokhal, Moshi RecSys MORSE Fulbright Scholarship ICLR Vision Language Model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-latentspace-这家创业公司说自己不是新彭博-而是交易员的推荐系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c5deeb7411e2beff-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">26:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>這家創業公司說自己不是新彭博，而是交易員的推薦系統</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創始人把公司定位為彭博、Claude和Netflix的結合體：價值不在給交易員更多數據，而在於像Netflix一樣主動推送他們自己想不到該看的二階關聯信號。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI創業</span><span class=\"tag\">大宗商品交易</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New Apex Predator: CrowdStrike CEO George Kurtz on Adversaries Armed With AI Agents pyramid of pain breakout time ablated models digital twin distillation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-nopriors-ai抹平攻击门槛-脚本小子也能用上国家级黑客的本事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad8f4d231b5e5ea8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">45:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>AI抹平攻擊門檻：腳本小子也能用上國家級黑客的本事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">開源大模型裝在家用電腦上就能造勒索軟件，入侵後平均29分鐘、最快27秒就能在系統裡橫向移動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Leveraged ETFs Really Work (Marco Sammon &amp; Chris Murray) | #432 convexity bonus volatility drag break-even return swap expected log wealth\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-rationalreminder-3倍杠杆etf跑赢正股-标的股票得先涨170/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>3倍槓桿ETF跑贏正股，標的股票得先漲170%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">槓桿ETF每天只盯日收益、不盯年化倍數：日波動5%的標的，3倍產品要漲170%才能反超正股本身——門檻隨波動率指數級跳升。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">槓桿ETF</span><span class=\"tag\">波動率損耗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bhaskar Sunkara Thinks the Market Has a Place Under Socialism market socialism soft budget constraint benchmark wage DSA Rawlsian liberalism labor-managed firm\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-oddlots-激进版社会主义-土地全部公有-但房租仍由市场决定/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">53:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>激進版社會主義：土地全部公有，但房租仍由市場決定</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他主張，社會主義不必靠配給：把土地和住房全部收歸公有後，仍可以保留按市場定價的租金和搬遷自由，用價格而不是配給來分配空間。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">市場社會主義</span><span class=\"tag\">工人所有制</span>\n</div></div></a>"]